Note on game assets
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license applies only to the tool source code in this repository.

It does NOT grant any rights to Metal Max 3 (the game), its ROM images,
graphics, text, music or any other assets. This project contains no game ROM.
The patch table reproduces a few hundred bytes of machine code addresses that
are required to locate and patch the game's own code; you still need to own a
legitimate copy of the game to use it.

"Metal Max" is a trademark of its respective owners.
